# Project-local Codex command execution rules.
#
# Codex `.rules` files are Starlark files for sandbox-escalation policy,
# not general repository guidance. Keep behavioral workflow instructions in
# `AGENTS.md`, `docs/`, and active skills under `.codex/skills/`.
#
# This project intentionally defines no project-local auto-allow rules yet.
# Add `prefix_rule(...)` entries only for recurring commands that are safe to
# run outside the sandbox without weakening review of destructive or external
# side effects.
